## 🎯 The 3 Environment Variables

### HEADED - Browser Visibility
```bash
npm run test:headed          # HEADED=true (visible)
npm test                     # HEADED=false (hidden)

# Use for: Debugging, watching tests run
```

### CUCUMBER_TAGS - Filter Tests
```bash
npm run test:tags                              # @smoke
CUCUMBER_TAGS="@critical" npm test             # @critical
CUCUMBER_TAGS="@smoke and not @wip" npm test   # Complex

# Use for: Running specific test suites
```

### CUCUMBER_WORKERS - Parallel Execution
```bash
npm test                     # 0 workers (serial)
npm run test:parallel        # 4 workers (parallel)
CUCUMBER_WORKERS=2 npm test  # 2 workers

# Use for: Speeding up test runs
```

