## 🎓 How to Use

### Step 1: Choose Your Mode
```
Debug?    → npm run test:headed
Fast?     → npm run test:parallel
Specific? → CUCUMBER_TAGS="@tag" npm test
```

### Step 2: Add Tags to Feature Files
```gherkin
@smoke @critical
Scenario: Your test
  Given some step
```

### Step 3: Run Your Tests
```bash
npm run test:headed          # Debug mode
npm run test:parallel        # Fast mode
CUCUMBER_TAGS="@smoke" npm test  # Specific tests
```

