## ❓ Common Questions

**Q: Which script should I use normally?**
A: `npm run test:parallel` (fast and reliable)

**Q: Why isn't my test running?**
A: Check if tag starts with `@` and tag expression is correct

**Q: How do I debug a specific test?**
A: `npm run test:headed` or `HEADED=true CUCUMBER_TAGS="@specific" npm test`

**Q: Is parallel really faster?**
A: Yes! 3-4x faster on most systems

**Q: Can I change the default tag?**
A: Yes! Edit `package.json` scripts section

